      "id": "pbhf-02",
      "title": "Loyalty and refill loops are strategic growth systems",
      "summary": "Rituals reports tens of millions of loyalty members and millions of refills, making replenishment, refill education, and personalized member journeys first-class product concerns.",
      "implication": "Keep loyalty, profile, replenishment, refill compatibility, promotions, and inventory availability in one member operating loop.",
      "priority": "high",
      "tags": [
