      "id": "pbhf-04",
      "title": "Boutique operations are part of the product, not only retail execution",
      "summary": "The category leaders use large owned and franchised store estates, meaning store stock accuracy, advisor tooling, pickup readiness, task execution, and assisted checkout materially shape customer outcomes.",
      "implication": "Give store advisors and operators explicit customer status in the domain and assign bricks for point of sale, appointments, clienteling, store stock, and task execution.",
      "priority": "high",
      "tags": [
        "store-operations",
        "assisted-commerce"
